infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Four brakes to stop a recursive CTE from looping forever
  desc Without one, a cycle spins until work_mem spills to disk and the query hangs
  lists
    - label CYCLE clause (PG14+)
      desc Declarative cycle detection; stops revisiting a node already on the path — preferred on real graphs
    - label Visited-array path check
      desc Any version: carry ARRAY[node], add WHERE NOT node = ANY(path); catches every graph cycle
    - label UNION, not UNION ALL
      desc Dedupes each pass against the result; stops simple repeats but slower and misses some graph cycles
    - label Depth cap (WHERE depth < 50)
      desc The seatbelt you add regardless — bounds an unbounded walk even with cycle protection on
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
